      en: ["Third largest city in Kazakhstan after Almaty and Astana", "Founded in the 12th century as a stop along the Silk Road", "Major center for lead smelting and the petroleum industry", "Attained the status of a city of national significance in 2018", "Situated in a fertile oasis within the Sayram-Su River valley", "Famed for the Shymkent Zoo, one of the largest in the country"],
