      en: ["Founded in 1640 by the merchant Guriy Nazarov.", "The Ural River divides the city into European and Asian sides.", "The city was renamed from Guryev to Atyrau in 1991.", "The Atyrau region produces approximately 60% of Kazakhstan's oil.", "The city's lowest elevation is 28 meters below sea level.", "The pedestrian bridge over the Ural is over 400 meters long."],
