      en: ["The city was strictly known as Tselinograd-25 until the 1990s.", "Stepnogorsk was home to a major Soviet microbiological research facility.", "The settlement was officially granted city status in 1964.", "Nearby gold mines are among the deepest in all of Kazakhstan.", "Stepnogorsk is located approximately 185 kilometers from Astana.", "The city is a significant center for Kazakhstan's chemical industry today."],
      es: ["Fundada en 1964", "Población: ~45.000", "Producción de uranio: 2.000 t anuales", "Altitud: 300 m", "Superficie: 30 km²", "Distancia a Astaná: 200 km"],
      pt: ["Fundada em 1964", "População: ~45.000", "Produção de urânio: 2.000 t anuais", "Altitude: 300 m", "Área: 30 km²", "Distância até Astana: 200 km"],
      fr: ["Fondée en 1964", "Population : ~45 000", "Production d'uranium : 2 000 t par an", "Altitude : 300 m", "Superficie : 30 km²", "Distance d'Astana : 200 km"],
